    "### 3.2 The temperature columns\n",
    "\n",
    "Rank will not help here: tempC and atempC are not *exactly* dependent. Instead, look at the eigenvalues of the **correlation matrix of the four weather predictors**. A near-zero eigenvalue signals a near-dependency, and its eigenvector tells you *which* combination of columns is nearly constant."
   ]
