   "source": [
    "**Long-run share of days in each state.** The stationary distribution $\\boldsymbol\\pi$ satisfies $\\boldsymbol\\pi^T P = \\boldsymbol\\pi^T$, that is, $P^T\\boldsymbol\\pi = 1\\cdot\\boldsymbol\\pi$. So $\\boldsymbol\\pi$ is an **eigenvector of $P^T$ with eigenvalue 1**, rescaled to sum to 1."
   ]
  },
