    "**Expected days until the next clear day.** Let $\\mathbf{Q}$ be the rows and columns of $P$ for the *not-clear* states (mist, rain). The expected number of days until weather is next clear, $\\mathbf{t}$, solves $(\\mathbf{I} - \\mathbf{Q})\\,\\mathbf{t} = \\mathbf{1}$."
